# Basic Wallet — release build identity

When David asks for a **real release** (APK/AAB, store build, version bump + ship, “crea una release”, “release reale”):

1. Set `APP_GIT_COMMIT` in `app/src/buildInfo.ts` to the real short git hash (`git rev-parse --short HEAD`). Do **not** ship with `"dev"`.
2. Keep `APP_VERSION` in sync with `app/package.json` and `app/app.json` (SemVer).
3. If `LICENSE` is on GitHub, set `APP_LICENSE_URL` to the blob URL (today still `"#"`).
4. Release builds use mainnet ASP (`__DEV__` false → `https://arkade.computer`).

Mind: `~/Mind/topics/basic-wallet/entities/basic-wallet.md` (topic **not** under Arklabs).
